@startuml Sequence_Booking_Concurrency_MediLink
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220

title Sequence Diagram 1 (ASR-01 & ASR-02): Chống Double-Booking Đa tầng & Cách ly Lỗi HIS qua Outbox

actor "Bệnh nhân A\n(Đến trước)" as P1
actor "Bệnh nhân B\n(Đến cùng lúc +2ms)" as P2
participant "Gateway &\nRate Limiter" as GW
participant "BookingService &\nIdempotency" as BS
participant "LockManager\n(Redis SET NX PX)" as LOCK
database "SQLite WAL DB\n(UNIQUE Constraint)" as DB
participant "ACL Dispatcher &\nCircuitBreaker" as ACL
participant "Mock HIS Cơ sở\n(REST / SOAP XML)" as HIS
participant "BackgroundWorker\n(Outbox & Queue)" as WORKER

== Tranh chấp đồng thời cùng 1 khung giờ (DOC_101 @ 08:00) ==
P1 -> GW: POST /api/bookings (doc=DOC_101, slot=08:00, X-Idempotency-Key=K1)
P2 -> GW: POST /api/bookings (doc=DOC_101, slot=08:00, X-Idempotency-Key=K2)

GW -> BS: createBooking(reqA, K1)
GW -> BS: createBooking(reqB, K2)

BS -> DB: Kiểm tra idempotency_keys(K1) -> Chưa tồn tại
BS -> LOCK: INCR fencing_seq & SET lock:slot:DOC_101:08:00 "reqA:41" NX PX 3000
LOCK --> BS: OK (Acquired, fencingToken = 41)

BS -> LOCK: SET lock:slot:DOC_101:08:00 "reqB:42" NX PX 3000
LOCK --> BS: NULL (Lock đang bị giữ bởi reqA)
BS --> GW: HTTP 409 Conflict (SLOT_LOCKED_CONCURRENT_CONFLICT - Fast-fail < 10ms)
GW --> P2: 409 Conflict ("Khung giờ đang có người giữ chỗ, gợi ý slot 08:30")

== Ghi nhận nguyên tử tại RDBMS & Nhả khóa sớm (Không giữ khóa khi chờ mạng HIS) ==
BS -> DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE; INSERT bookings (UNIQUE active_slot_key, fencing=41); UPDATE slots='BOOKED'; COMMIT
DB --> BS: Commit thành công (bookingId = BK-9001)
BS -> LOCK: EVAL Lua Atomic Unlock (chỉ xóa nếu value == "reqA:41")
LOCK --> BS: 1 (Released)

== Liên thông HIS qua Anti-Corruption Layer (Chuẩn HL7 FHIR Patient + Appointment) ==
BS -> ACL: syncAppointment(facilityId, payload + MPI)
ACL -> ACL: Map sang HL7 FHIR R4 {Patient, Appointment} & kiểm tra CircuitBreaker

alt HIS Cơ sở hoạt động bình thường (Circuit CLOSED)
    ACL -> HIS: POST Appointment (Timeout Budget = 1500ms, X-Idempotency-Key=K1)
    HIS --> ACL: 201 Created (hisReferenceCode = "DN-HIS-1001")
    ACL --> BS: { success: true, hisReferenceCode: "DN-HIS-1001" }
    BS -> DB: UPDATE bookings SET his_sync_status = 'SYNCED'
else HIS Cơ sở Huế bị sập hoặc Timeout > 1500ms (ASR-02 & ADR-007)
    ACL -x HIS: 503 Service Unavailable / Timeout (hoặc Fast-fail ngay nếu Circuit = OPEN)
    ACL --> BS: Throw Error (Tăng failureCount -> Mở mạch OPEN khi >= 3 lỗi)
    BS -> DB: INSERT INTO outbox_events(BK-9001, 'PENDING') & SET his_sync_status = 'OUTBOX_QUEUED'
end

BS -> DB: INSERT INTO notification_jobs(ZALO_ZNS_SMS) & INSERT INTO audit_logs(HMAC-SHA256)
BS -> DB: Lưu kết quả vào idempotency_keys(K1)
BS --> GW: HTTP 201 Created (Booking Confirmed)
GW --> P1: 201 Created (Trả mã lịch hẹn ngay, không chờ cổng SMS/HIS treo)

== Phục hồi tự động ở chế độ nền (Architecture v2 Rate-Controlled Outbox) ==
loop Định kỳ khi Circuit chuyển HALF_OPEN / CLOSED
    WORKER -> DB: SELECT pending outbox_events (Batch = 5)
    WORKER -> WORKER: Sleep Jitter ngẫu nhiên (20..60ms) chống Thundering Herd
    WORKER -> ACL: syncAppointment(BK-9001)
    ACL -> HIS: POST SOAP/REST (kèm IdempotencyToken chống ghi trùng)
    HIS --> ACL: 200 OK (MaTiepDonHue = "HUE-XML-2001")
    WORKER -> DB: UPDATE outbox_events='SYNCED', bookings.his_sync_status='SYNCED'
end

legend right
  |= Ký hiệu |= Ý nghĩa kiến trúc |
  | Đồng bộ (Mũi tên liền) | Luồng HTTP/SQLite/Redis trong phạm vi Request (< 150ms) |
  | Bất đồng bộ (Worker Loop) | Luồng Outbox & Notification tách rời, chịu lỗi độc lập |
  | Chốt chặn 3 lớp | Idempotency Key -> Redis Lock + Fencing -> SQLite UNIQUE |
endlegend
@enduml
